      "cat-harness:section": "Site presentation assets — the node is the source, the stylesheet is a rendering",
      "prov:value": "The owner's requirement, and the whole of it:"
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/ui/theming/site-presentation-assets.md#provenance-2",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "Site presentation assets — the node is the source, the stylesheet is a rendering",
      "prov:value": "Authoring the stylesheet by hand beside the nodes gives **two answers to one\nquestion**, free to disagree — and they do disagree, silently, because nothing\ncompares a hex triple in a `.css` file with a hex triple in a `.ts` file. This is\nthe same failure as a hand-written `title:` in a Jekyll config next to a declared\ninstance name, which diverged the day it was written."
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/ui/theming/site-presentation-assets.md#provenance-3",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "What this skill does not cover",
      "prov:value": "## Why this skill exists at all, recorded because the gap was the finding"
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/ui/theming/site-presentation-assets.md#provenance-4",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "Why this skill exists at all, recorded because the gap was the finding",
      "prov:value": "That is the third mismatch in\n[`covered-is-not-reachable`](../../tools/folio-core/covered-is-not-reachable.md), and it is invisible to\n`bun run cat tools:coverage` by construction: that tool enumerates **skills** and asks\nwhich lack Tools, so a capability nobody stated is absent from the list it walks.\nBean `yean`.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "bean yean"
      ]
    }
